      "## Introduction: The Power of WhatsApp for Businesses",
      "",
      "In 2026, WhatsApp has reached over 3 billion users worldwide. In Turkey, it is the most popular messaging application with 50 million+ active users. So, is your business reaching this massive audience?",
      "",
      "WhatsApp Business API is an official tool that allows businesses to communicate with their customers at scale, automatically, and in a personalized way. In this guide, we will address everything from API setup to chatbot integration, from automation strategies to AI applications.",
      "",
      "## 1. What is WhatsApp Business API and Why is it Necessary?",
