      "- Multi-language support (Turkish, English, Arabic)",
      "- Sentiment analysis (customer satisfaction measurement)",
      "- Recommendation system (similar products, upsell)",
      "- Human handoff (in complex situations)",
      "",
      "## 4. Template Messages and Approval Process",
      "",
      "WhatsApp requires businesses to get approval for every template message they send. Here are the best practices:",
      "",
      "## Template Categories:",
      "",
      "1. Transaction Notifications (Utility): Order confirmation, shipping tracking",
      "2. Marketing: Campaigns, discounts",
      "3. Authentication (Authentication): OTP, verification codes",
